.TH ngx-init 1  "ngx-init " 
.SH NAME
ngx\-init \- Create sites\-available/ + sites\-enabled/ and include them from nginx.conf (Arch, RHEL, …)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBngx\-init\fR [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create sites\-available/ + sites\-enabled/ and include them from nginx.conf (Arch, RHEL, …)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Don\*(Aqt ask for confirmation
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would change without touching anything
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
